# Campaign evidence capture directory (MOGO-005 B-3).
#
# scripts/mogo_evidence_receiver.js writes captured evidence here by default. Evidence is
# CAPTURED here and then PRESERVED deliberately -- it must never be committed as a side effect
# of a routine `git add`. A replay package is an observation, not source code, and committing
# one by accident would put an un-reviewed artifact into the repository's history permanently.
#
# This file ignores everything in this directory except itself, which also keeps the directory
# present in a fresh clone so the receiver's default output path exists before first use.
*
!.gitignore
